   "source": [
    "# 01 Data preparation and statistical inference\n",
    "**Puneet Jaiswal | QM640 Data Analytics Capstone | October 20, 2026**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook handles source audit, cleaning, EDA, exact-quarter feature/target construction, sample-size planning and statistical regression inference. Its OLS regression estimates associations, joint slope tests, coefficients and uncertainty. It does not train or compare predictive model families or report held-out MAE/RMSE.\n",
    "\n",
    "",
    "\n",
    "**RQ coverage:** RQ1 joint association and RQ2 coefficient inference are evaluated here. RQ1 forecasting usefulness, RQ2 predictive importance, RQ3 model comparisons and RQ4 feature-set comparison are evaluated in Notebook 02. Splitting the workflow does not imply that all four questions can be answered without fitted-model predictions.\n",
    "\n",

   ]
  },
